No, it hits you directly, but it's the vapours of the potion that you
breathe (or that get in your eyes) that take effect, rather than the
splashed liquid; if you're polymorphed into an eyeless breathless
monster, you won't be paralysed in this manner. The only potions that
take effect directly by hitting you are polymorph, acid, and burning
oil (the last only if you threw it up and missed the ceiling, since
monsters don't use Molotov cocktails).

